# Answer 3 · "Women Hold Up Half the Sky": Do We Need Equal Numbers of Women in Public Life? (CSS 2018)
@py question 2018-7

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
